            "body": "This release contains changes for datasets:\n\n- Rubella virus E1 region (nextstrain/rubella/E1)\n- Rubella (nextstrain/rubella/genome)\n- Coxsackievirus A10 (enpen/enterovirus/cva10)\n\n\n\n## Rubella virus E1 region (nextstrain/rubella/E1)\n\n- Correct the description of the genotyping window and of the reference sequence in the README.\n\n\n\n\n## Rubella (nextstrain/rubella/genome)\n\n- Replace the README text, which described the measles dataset, with a description of the rubella genome dataset.\n\n\n\n\n## Coxsackievirus A10 (enpen/enterovirus/cva10)\n\nInitial release of a Coxsackievirus A10 dataset for lineage classification!\n\nRead more about Nextclade datasets in the documentation: https://docs.nextstrain.org/projects/nextclade/en/stable/user/datasets.html\n\n",
